<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on Taiwan steel basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Taiwan steel basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Thursday it issued 20 million American-style composite call warrants on shares of a basket of four Taiwan steel shares.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Steel Corp			 2 shares</p>
<p> Tung Ho Steel			    1 share</p>
<p> Feng Hsin Iron			   1 share</p>
<p> Yieh Phui Enterprise Co		1 share</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 US$6.46	 PREMIUM	 16.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  US$1.047	GEARING	 6.2x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   10.FEB.98</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     US$6.46</p>
<p> LISTING		LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
